# Normalise line endings so Windows and Linux checkouts agree.
* text=auto

# NO Git LFS in this repository.
#
# The previous .gitattributes routed *.png, *.jpg, *.webp, fonts and PDFs through
# Git LFS. Vercel's build clone does not fetch LFS objects, so every one of those
# files deployed as a ~130-byte text pointer instead of the real file — the trailer
# photos rendered as broken images on the live site while looking perfectly fine
# in the local repo.
#
# Anything under public/ is served directly by the site and must be a real blob.
# These are a handful of a few hundred kilobytes each; LFS buys nothing here and
# costs a silent production failure. If genuinely large media ever needs version
# control, host it in Supabase Storage rather than reintroducing LFS.

# Binary types that should never be line-ending converted.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.svg   text
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.mov   binary
